-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("es",406,{
[12961]="7004A8F5\n1\tPatrol Iant Angos \"in search of the Elf-warrior\"\tIant Angos can be found to the south-east of Cirith Ungol in Lhingris. Captain Róglarg has asked you to patrol Iant Angos in search of the Elf-warrior on the run in Lhingris. You should travel to the bridge of Iant Angos.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have patrolled Iant Angos.\n",
[12962]="7004A8FC\n1\tPatrol Torech Ungol \"in search of the Elf-warrior\"\tTorech Ungol can be found up the pathway south-west of Cirith Ungol in the heights of the Ephel Dúath. Captain Róglarg has asked you to patrol Torech Ungol, Shelob's Lair, in search of the Elf-warrior on the run in Lhingris. You should travel to Torech Ungol, but remain on guard.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have patrolled Torech Ungol.\n",
[12963]="70018C28\n1\tRecolecta muérdago (total: 5)\tPuedes encontrar muérdago en los jóvenes abetos a lo largo del camino del norte hacia el Refugio de caza de Thrasi. Saervereth te pidió que recolectaras algo de muérdago para que pudiera recordar el verdadero significado de Yule.\n2\tLleva el muérdago a Saervereth en Duillond\tSaervereth se encuentra en Duillond, en la zona del festival. Saervereth estará ansiosa por ver el muérdago y reflexionar sobre el verdadero significado de Yule.\n",
[12964]="70042F59\n1\tSearch for the lost Ranger outside the Palace of Eldacar\tThe Palace of Eldacar can be found due west of Halhir in western Osgiliath. Halhir has asked you to search near the Palace of Eldacar for a lost ally.\n2\tSearch the Palace of Eldacar for the lost Ranger\tThe Palace of Eldacar can be found due west of Halhir in western Osgiliath. You have not found Halhir's ally, and should now search within the ruins of the Palace.\n3\tExamine the slain Ranger\tThe Palace of Eldacar can be found due west of Halhir in western Osgiliath. You have spotted a crumpled body in the distance. You should examine it before leaving the Palace.\n4\tTalk to Halhir\tHalhir can be found due east of the Palace of Eldacar in western Osgiliath. You have found Halhir's slain ally, and should now return to him bearing the news of his friend's passing.\n",
[12965]="7005B223\n1\tObtain bat bait from an Orc beast-master\tThe Orc village Dalugronk is located on the lowest level of Deepscrave, to the north-east of Aslíf. The Orc beast-masters may have bait that you can use to lure out the bat Sumri.\n2\tLure out and defeat Sumri\tYou have obtained bait to lure Sumri out.\n3\tTalk to Elta near Shataz-kordh\tYou have defeated Sumri. Elta waits for you nearby to the north-west, watching the worm nest Shataz-kordh.\n",
[12966]="70002D16\n1\tAcepta el desafío de Donnan\tDonnan y su hermano están en Aughaire, en el lado oeste del pueblo de los montañeses, esperando tu respuesta a su desafío. Arzhur te ha pedido una vez más que luches contra los retadores de un clan hostil leal a Angmar.\n2\tArzhur está en Aughaire. Debes regresar con Arzhur para informarle de tu victoria en el segundo desafío.\t\n",
[12967]="7000007A\n1\tEncuentra el segundo engranaje perdido\tEl cofre que contiene el segundo engranaje puede encontrarse en el lado sur de las ruinas infestadas de trasgos en el Valle de Thráin, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin y al oeste de Noglond. Bávor descubrió la ubicación del segundo engranaje y te ha enviado a buscarlo mientras él repara el primero.\n2\tLleva el segundo engranaje a Bávor\030Recoge Gear\tBávor está en la Mansión de Thorin. Bávor estará complacido de ver que has conseguido el segundo engranaje.\n",
[12968]="700572FA\n1\tInspect the illusion of the second stone\tAn illusion has appeared before you in the Crown Chamber. You should inspect the illusion of the second stone.\n2\tFind the second stone\tThe missing stone is out there somewhere, waiting to be found.\n3\tFind the second stone\tThe missing stone is out there somewhere, waiting to be found.\n4\tTalk to the Emissary\tYou have found a hidden chamber in the Mountains of Shadow, but a Nameless entity stands in your way.\n5\tFind the first remnant\030Find the second remnant\030Find the third remnant\030Find the fourth remnant\030Find the fifth remnant\030Find the sixth remnant\030Find the seventh remnant\tThe Emissary has asked you to find the \"Remnants of the Fallen Ones\" and return them.\n6\tTalk to the Emissary and 'Speak the Words'\tYou have collected the remnants for the Emissary. You should return to the Emissary and 'Speak the Words'.\n7\tReturn the stone to its pedestal\tYou have found one of the missing stones! You should return them to their rightful place in the Crown Chamber.\n",
[12969]="7001752A\n1\tDescubre y elimina el motivo de la preocupación de Lar\tLa Sala Decimosexta se encuentra al noreste del Refugio Sombrío. Lar te ha pedido que te adentres en lo más profundo de la Sala Decimosexta y trates de encontrar el origen de su inquietud.\n2\tRegresa con Lar en el Refugio Sombrío\tLar se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al suroeste de la Sala Decimosexta. Vuelve con Lar y dile lo que has descubierto y matado: una terrible criatura sin cabeza en las profundidades de la sala, acechando en una habitación llena de esporas y baba.\n",
[12970]="7006595F\n1\tCollect savoury herbs (total: 8)\tJódha has asked you to pick some savoury herbs outside of Pelargir. Find herbs in the fields west of Pelargir.\n2\tTalk to Jódha\tYou have found enough herbs to satisfy Jódha. Deliver the savoury herbs to Jódha.\n",
[12971]="700444E9\n1\tLook for the key (total: 6)\tThe Wrights' Fellow-hall lies on the far southern end of the First Circle. Bergil knows of a second, unwatched door into the Cisterns, which might grant the children passage directly to the Fourth Circle. A key to it was lost near the Wrights' Fellow-hall recently. Search for it in that area.\n2\tFound the key\tFound the key.\n3\tTalk to Bergil\tBergil waits in front of the Old Guest-house, in the First Circle, just south of the City Gates. Tell Bergil you found the key to the cisterns' hidden door. With it, the children might find passage directly to the Fourth Circle.\n4\tTalk to Gelwen\tGelwen stands in front of the Old Guest-house, in the First Circle, just south of the City Gates. Bergil says two other children, Gelwen and Glatham, would like to join you in searching the cisterns for the secret passage. He suggested that you speak with Gelwen herself, first.\n5\tEnter the cisterns through the hidden door\tThe door can be found near the Wrights' Fellow-hall, in the southern stretch of the First Circle. Enter the cisterns through the hidden door.\n6\tTalk to Gelwen\tIf you get separated from the children, use Bergil's whistle to call them to you. You have met Bergil, Gelwen, and Glatham in the cisterns. Gelwen has something to say.\n7\tExit into the Fourth Circle\tIf you get separated from the children, use Bergil's whistle to call them to you. Explore the cisterns with Bergil, Gelwen, and Glatham, and search for a passage up to the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\n8\tTalk to Gelwen\tIf you get separated from the children, use Bergil's whistle to call them to you. You have come out of the secret passage through the cisterns, to the Fourth Circle of the City. Gelwen again appears to have something she wishes to say.\n9\tInvestigate the Finding Place\tThe Finding Place lies near the cisterns' exit in the Fourth Circle. The children have spotted something they call the \"Finding Place.\" Walk over to it and see what it is. If you get separated, use Bergil's whistle to call the children to you.\n10\tIf you get separated from the children, use Bergil's whistle to call them to you. Show Bergil the slightly crumpled letter you found in the crevice of the Finding Place.\t\n11\tHabla con Bergil\tThe Old Guest-house lies in the First Circle, just south of the City Gates. Meet Bergil and the other children back at the Old Guest-house.\n",
[12972]="7005AAFF\n1\tTalk to Hórin outside Bagud-dum and go with him to investigate\tHórin is standing by outside Bagud-dum. You should speak to Hórin and complete 'Instance: The Secret Ritual'.\n2\tTalk to Hórin just outside the door to the keep in Bagud-dum\tHórin has dragged you out of Bagud-dum. You should talk to Hórin.\n3\tComplete 'Apprentices of the Cult' for Hórin\030Complete 'Spirits and Summoners' for Hórin\030Find Loknashra inside the keep of Bagud-dum\tThe Angmarim cultists have taken over the dwarf-fort Bagud-dum. You should complete objectives in Bagud-dum to prevent their plans from reaching fruition.\n4\tTalk to Hórin outside Bagud-dum\tHórin is waiting for you outside Bagud-dum. You should talk to Hórin.\n",
[12973]="70054F37\n1\tHabla con Mithrandir\tMithrandir can be found in Falch Gurth. Mithrandir has asked you to accompany him into Thuringwath. You should talk to Mithrandir when you are prepared.\n2\tTalk to Mithrandir in Thuringwath\tMithrandir can be found in Thuringwath. You have passed through Falch Gurth into Thuringwath with Mithrandir. You should talk to Mithrandir.\n",
[12974]="7004CE2D\n1\tConsulta el objetivo de esta etapa en el diario.\t\n2\tCollect the dusty tome\tKing Thorin III can be found at his seat in Erebor. You should bring the tome to King Thorin III.\n3\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III can be found at his seat in Erebor. You should bring the tome to King Thorin III.\n",
[12975]="7004E72A\n1\tExamine the spider corpse\tA spider corpse can be found deep within Stormwall, high in the mountains north-east of Skarháld. You should examine the spider corpse.\n2\tTalk to Agátur\tYou should return to Agátur, back in Skarháld.\n",
[12976]="70042F27\n1\tInvestigate the ruins of Tuntham\tThe ruins of Tuntham can be found north-east of Bâr Húrin. You should enter the suspicious building at Tuntham.\n2\tEnter the ruined interior of Tuntham\tThe ruins of Tuntham can be found north-east of Bâr Húrin. You should enter the suspicious building at Tuntham.\n3\tBreak up the Orkish planning committee (total: 3)\tThe ruins of Tuntham can be found north-east of Bâr Húrin. You should defeat the Orkish planning committee you found within one of the buildings in Tuntham.\n4\tDestroy the Orkish plans\tThe ruins of Tuntham can be found north-east of Bâr Húrin. You should destroy the Orkish plans you found within one of the buildings in Tuntham.\n5\tCompletado\tDestroyed the Orkish plans.\n",
[12977]="700033BC\n1\tLleva el collar con runas al Elfo cerca de Casa del Bosque\tPuede que un Elfo esté acampado cerca de Casa del Bosque, al sur de Bolgovado. Linda Bolger quedó desconcertada por tu hallazgo de un collar donde ella había visto al gran lobo. No pudo leer las letras del collar, pero pensó que quizá el Elfo que Milo creyó ver podría descifrarlas.\n",
[12978]="700176CD\n1\tDescubre la entrada a la cámara secreta\tLa entrada se encuentra en algún lugar de Nud-melek, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, quizá en la Segunda Sala. Geirfast te ha pedido que encuentres la entrada a la cámara secreta representada en el mapa de sombras.\n2\tHabla con Geirfast\tGeirfast se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste de la Segunda Sala. Deberías regresar con Geirfast para contarle dónde se halla la cámara.\n3\tGeirfast se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera. Deberías hablar con Geirfast cuando estés listo para viajar.\t\n4\tHabla con Geirfast en la Sala Vigesimoprimera\tGeirfast se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera. Deberías regresar de inmediato con Geirfast.\n5\tHabla con Lenglammel en el Refugio Sombrío\tLenglammel se encuentra acampada en el Refugio Sombrío. Geirfast te sugirió que hablaras con la elfa Lenglammel.\n",
[12979]="700085DA\n1\tHabla con Nethraw\tEl maestro del saber Nethraw se encuentra en el Krúsle Lannan, a una considerable distancia al este de Gabilshathûr. Banfuir te sugirió que hablaras con el maestro del saber Nethraw.\n",
[12980]="7005F867\n1\tScout Lochan Dúv with Hersegg\tLochan Dúv can be found to the west of Lugun-nâla in Gloomingtarn. Hersegg has asked you to accompany her in combatting the Iron Crown at Lochan Dúv. You should travel to Lochan Dúv with Hersegg. NOTE: If you become separated from Hersegg, use the horn she gave you to summon her back to your side.\n2\tHabla con Hersegg\tHersegg can be found at your side. You have entered Lochan Dúv with Hersegg. You should talk to Hersegg. NOTE: If you become separated from Hersegg, use the horn she gave you to summon her back to your side.\n3\tDefeat the Iron Crown commander at Lochan Dúv\030Aid Hersegg with 'Curious Captives'\tThe Iron Crown commander can be found at Lochan Dúv. Hersegg can be found at your side. You should defeat the Iron Crown commander at Lochan Dúv and aid Hersegg with her task. NOTE: If you become separated from Hersegg, use the horn she gave you to summon her back to your side.\n4\tHabla con Hersegg\tHersegg can be found at your side. You have defeated the Iron Crown commander and helped to sow discord at Lochan Dúv. You should talk to Hersegg. NOTE: If you become separated from Hersegg, use the horn she gave you to summon her back to your side.\n5\tFind the entrance to Mîn Lorg\tThe entrance to Mîn Lorg can be found somewhere within Lochan Dúv in Gloomingtarn. The Iron Crown commander held orders demanding an excavation of Mîn Lorg before the arrival of his master, Allaban the Collector. You should search for the entrance to Mîn Lorg. NOTE: If you become separated from Hersegg, use the horn she gave you to summon her back to your side.\n6\tHabla con Hersegg\tHersegg can be found at your side. You have found the entrance to Mîn Lorg. You should talk to Hersegg. NOTE: If you become separated from Hersegg, use the horn she gave you to summon her back to your side.\n7\tTalk to Hersegg at Mîn Lorg\tHersegg can be found at the entrance to Mîn Lorg within Lochan Dúv in Gloomingtarn. You have found the entrance to Mîn Lorg. You should talk to Hersegg.\n",
[12981]="70062DD8\n1\tBusca pistas\tRhiangar te ha pedido que estés atento a cualquier señal de que su madre pudo haber visitado Sarch Vorn. Sarch Vorn está en el norte de Cardolan.\n2\tLleva el collar a Rhiangar\tHas encontrado un viejo collar en el esqueleto desgastado por el clima de una mujer. Sospechas que Rhiangar estaría interesada en este objeto. Deberías llevarle el collar a Herne.\n",
[12982]="70048C85\n1\tTalk to Viznak\tViznak can be found near Seregost. You should talk to Viznak.\n2\tDerrota a las merrevail (total: 14)\tViznak has been ambushed by merrevail on Seregost's terrace! You should defeat the merrevail.\n3\tFind an entrance into Seregost\tViznak has been taken into Seregost. You should find a way inside.\n4\tHabla con Rhadrog\tRhadrog is standing by inside the prison. You should talk to Rhadrog.\n5\tTalk to the Nurnhoth prisoner\030Talk to the Easterling prisoner\tLiving prisoners can be found inside the prison. You should talk to these prisoners.\n6\tHabla con Rhadrog\tRhadrog is right next to you! You should talk to Rhadrog.\n7\tTalk to the Uruk Prisoner\tLiving prisoners can be found inside the prison. You should talk to these prisoners.\n8\tFind Viznak\tViznak is somewhere deeper in the prison. Now that you have the information you need, you should find Viznak.\n9\tDefeat the Blood-witch\030Defeat Stained merrevail (total: 2)\tThe Blood-witch can be found in the deepest chamber of Seregost's prison. You should defeat the Blood-witch and her merrevail.\n10\tRun!\tBolvág the Cursed is chasing you! You should run!\n11\tHabla con Rhadrog\tYou have managed to escape with Rhadrog and Viznak. You should talk to Rhadrog.\n",
[12983]="700571C5\n1\tTalk to Agátur outside of Sundergrót\tSundergrót can be found in the Floodfells. You should talk to Agátur outside of Sundergrót.\n2\tTalk to Rúzat at Limlók\030Talk to Agátur at Limlók\030Talk to Náth at Limlók\tRúzat, Agátur, and Náth can be found at Limlók. You should talk to the three dwarves.\n",
[12984]="700718E4\n1\tDefeat wights at Naxar Dâl (total: 4)\tAndûmu has asked you to examine the grave goods buried with the people in north-eastern An Shêru to learn something of who they were and what their lives were like. You should start at Naxar Dâl, north of Gadim-ûn, and defeat some wights there to clear some space for yourself.\n2\tAndûmu has asked you to examine the grave goods buried with the people in north-eastern An Shêru to learn something of who they were and what their lives were like. You started at Naxar Dâl, north of Gadim-ûn, and defeated some of the wights, clearing some space for yourself.\t\n3\tDefeat wights at Khâb Daku (total: 4)\tAndûmu has asked you to examine the grave goods buried with the people in north-eastern An Shêru to learn something of who they were and what their lives were like. You started at Naxar Dâl, north of Gadim-ûn, and should now go to the Crypts of Khâb Daku, to the south. Defeat some of the wights there to clear some space for yourself.\n4\tAndûmu has asked you to examine the grave goods buried with the people in north-eastern An Shêru to learn something of who they were and what their lives were like. You started at Naxar Dâl, north of Gadim-ûn, and next went to the Crypts of Khâb Daku, to the south, where you defeated some of the wights there, clearing some space for yourself.\t\n5\tTalk to Andûmu in Gadim-ûn\tAndûmu has asked you to examine the grave goods buried with the people in north-eastern An Shêru to learn something of who they were and what their lives were like. You started at Naxar Dâl, north of Gadim-ûn, and next went to the Crypts of Khâb Daku, examining grave goods at each location. You should return to Andûmu in Gadim-ûn and tell him what you discovered.\n",
[12985]="700598DA\n1\tHabla con Marigold\tTom te ha dicho que la espada se encuentra cerca del Viejo Hombre Sauce. Deberías colaborar con Marigold para encontrar la espada y destruirla.\n2\tCompleta «El infortunio del sauce» en cualquier nivel de dificultad\tCompleta «El infortunio del sauce» en cualquier nivel de dificultad. A partir del nivel 20, usa el Buscador de instancias para entrar en El infortunio del sauce.\n3\tHabla con Hob Guardacercas\tHob Guardacercas vigila el Portal del Este. Deberías contarle lo que ha sucedido desde la última vez que lo viste.\n",
[12986]="70027B59\n1\tRecoge raíces digestivas (total: 6)\tLas raíces digestivas se pueden encontrar por todo Tâl Methedras, alrededor de las orillas del lago y en el islote del centro del agua, al pie de los árboles.\n2\tMuele las raíces digestivas en la piedra de moler al norte de Herestan\tLa piedra de moler está en el pabellón de fabricación de armaduras al norte de Herestan. Ahora tienes algunas raíces digestivas y necesitas molerlas hasta hacerlas polvo.\n3\tLleva el polvo de raíces digestivas a Herestan\tHerestan está al sur de la piedra de moler, junto a la orilla del lago, donde lo dejaste.\n",
[12987]="700681C0\n1\tDefeat sekbiri (total: 8)\tA worried guard at the gate of Halrax has asked you to cull down the sekbir population in their den on the north side of the island. Sekbiri may be found at Ghar Jâdam to the north of Zamarzîr.\n",
[12988]="7005466E\n1\tFind Taurlingol\tAccording to the Rangers, the spider-infested forest of Taurlingol can be found in eastern Cirith Ungol. You should find Taurlingol.\n2\tFind the source of the shouting\tAs you entered Taurlingol, you heard someone shouting. You should find the source of the shouting.\n3\tHelp Atli defeat the spider\tYou have found Atli Spider-bane in combat with a giant spider of Taurlingol. You should help Atli defeat the spider!\n4\tTalk to Atli Spider-bane\tAtli has moved to a safe location nearby. You should find and talk to Atli Spider-bane.\n5\tHabla con Legolas.\tLegolas is tending to Atli Spider-bane's injuries on an overlook near Taurlingol. You should talk to Legolas.\n6\tHelp Legolas with 'The Daughters of Iphantemel'\030Help Legolas with 'The Trees of Taurlingol'\030Help Atli with 'Before They Become a Problem'\030Help Atli with 'The Only Solution'\tLegolas has asked for your assistance with tasks in Taurlingol. You should complete 'The Daughters of Iphantemel,' 'The Trees of Taurlingol,' 'Before They Become a Problem,' and 'The Only Solution.'\n7\tHabla con Legolas.\tYou should inform Legolas of your success defeating the Mirkwood Spiders. Legolas can be found on a hill near Taurlingol.\n",
[12989]="7002FD57\n1\tHabla con Odnoth\tLos dos soldados Rohirrim se encuentran en Campo de Lanzas y Gísling se encuentra en el Salón del Hidromiel Gísil quiere que hables con sus hombres y con su hijo, Gísling, acerca de qué medidas se pueden tomar para proteger Campo de Lanzas ahora que sabemos que la aldea está rodeada de enemigos.\n2\tHabla con Albryt\tLos dos soldados Rohirrim se encuentran en Campo de Lanzas y Gísling se encuentra en el Salón del Hidromiel Gísil quiere que hables con sus hombres y con su hijo, Gísling, acerca de qué medidas se pueden tomar para proteger Campo de Lanzas ahora que sabemos que la aldea está rodeada de enemigos.\n3\tHabla con Gísling\tLos dos soldados Rohirrim se encuentran en Campo de Lanzas y Gísling se encuentra dentro del Salón del Hidromiel. Gísil quiere que hables con sus hombres y con su hijo, Gísling, acerca de qué medidas se pueden tomar para proteger Campo de Lanzas ahora que sabemos que la aldea está rodeada de enemigos.\n4\tHabla con Gísil\tGísil se encuentra en el Salón del Hidromiel de Campo de Lanzas. Deberías volver con Gísil y informarle acerca de las opiniones de los consejeros.\n",
[12990]="7005718A\n1\tTravel to Thokvist in Misthallow\tThokvist can be found in the south of Misthallow. You should travel to Thokvist.\n2\tTalk to Léothred at Thokvist\tLéothred can be found at Thokvist. You should talk to Léothred.\n3\tDefeat Orcs in Misthallow (total: 6)\tOrcs can be found in Misthallow. You should defeat Orcs in Misthallow.\n4\tTalk to Léothred at Thokvist\tLéothred can be found at Thokvist. You should talk to Léothred.\n",
[12991]="700085E6\n1\tUsa Sword-sentinel\030Recoge The Sword of Arvedui\tLas estatuas de los Siete Centinelas se encuentran en el Templo de los Siete Centinelas, al este de Gabilshathûr. Las siete espadas deben ser entregadas a los Siete Centinelas en el orden correcto antes de que se abra la bóveda.\n2\tUsa Sword-sentinel\030Recoge The Sword of Rhudaur\tLas estatuas de los Siete Centinelas se encuentran en el Templo de los Siete Centinelas, al este de Gabilshathûr. Las siete espadas deben ser entregadas a los Siete Centinelas en el orden correcto antes de que se abra la bóveda.\n3\tUsa Sword-sentinel\030Recoge The Sword of Gondor\tLas estatuas de los Siete Centinelas se encuentran en el Templo de los Siete Centinelas, al este de Gabilshathûr. Las siete espadas deben ser entregadas a los Siete Centinelas en el orden correcto antes de que se abra la bóveda.\n4\tUsa Sword-sentinel\030Recoge The Sword of Slaughter\tLas estatuas de los Siete Centinelas se encuentran en el Templo de los Siete Centinelas, al este de Gabilshathûr. Las siete espadas deben ser entregadas a los Siete Centinelas en el orden correcto antes de que se abra la bóveda.\n5\tUsa Sword-sentinel\030Recoge The Sword of Sorrow\tLas estatuas de los Siete Centinelas se encuentran en el Templo de los Siete Centinelas, al este de Gabilshathûr. Las siete espadas deben ser entregadas a los Siete Centinelas en el orden correcto antes de que se abra la bóveda.\n6\tUsa Sword-sentinel\030Recoge The Sword of Twilight\tLas estatuas de los Siete Centinelas se encuentran en el Templo de los Siete Centinelas, al este de Gabilshathûr. Las siete espadas deben ser entregadas a los Siete Centinelas en el orden correcto antes de que se abra la bóveda.\n7\tUsa Sword-sentinel\030Recoge The Sword of the Vigil\tLas estatuas de los Siete Centinelas se encuentran en el Templo de los Siete Centinelas, al este de Gabilshathûr. Las siete espadas deben ser entregadas a los Siete Centinelas en el orden correcto antes de que se abra la bóveda.\n8\tLleva el tesoro de los Siete Centinelas de vuelta a Nethraw\030Recoge el tesoro de los Siete Centinelas\tHas resuelto el enigma de los Siete Centinelas, así que ahora es el momento de entrar en la bóveda y recuperar el tesoro.\n",
[12992]="7000D779\n1\tUsa Pedestal\tNethraw se encuentra en Kruslë Lannan, al este de Gabilshathûr. Debes colocar las siete espadas en sus pedestales para abrir Kruslë Lannan.\n2\tHabla con Nethraw\tBusca Kruslë Lannan con Nethraw.\n3\tEscapa de Kruslë Lannan\tDebes escapar de Kruslë Lannan con Nethraw.\n",
})
